        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OTEody0B3dEsDwfKsCuh-115" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;D_IDLE&lt;/code&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;是唯一允许接收新指令的状态。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;没有 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;instr_valid&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;：保持 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;D_IDLE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;OP_NOP&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;instr_ready=1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;，接收后直接丢弃。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;OP_END&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;instr_ready=1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;，产生一次 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;program_end_d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;OP_BARRIER&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;instr_ready=1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;，产生 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;barrier_trigger_d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt; 并进入 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;D_BARRIER&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;普通指令且引擎空闲：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;instr_ready&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;=1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;，保存字段、产生 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;issue_valid_d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt; 并进入 &lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;D_DECODE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;普通指令但引擎忙：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;instr_ready&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;=0&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;，不更新命令寄存内容，不消费当前微码。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1800" y="740" width="560" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OTEody0B3dEsDwfKsCuh-116" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline&quot; class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot;&gt;D_DECODE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 持续一个周期，然后无条件返回 &lt;div style=&quot;display:inline&quot; class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; data-token-index=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot;&gt;D_IDLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;。在该周期内，&lt;div style=&quot;display:inline&quot; class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; data-token-index=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot;&gt;instr_ready&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 使用默认值 &lt;div style=&quot;display:inline&quot; class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; data-token-index=&quot;6&quot; style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;，所以 Decode 不会同时接收另一条普通指令.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;该状态实际表述：&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;cmd_*_q 已经有效&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;对应 *_cmd_valid 正在拉高&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;issue_valid_q 正在通知 Scoreboard&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1800" y="1020" width="520" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OTEody0B3dEsDwfKsCuh-117" value="&lt;div class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot; style=&quot;display:inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot;&gt;D_BARRIER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 已经消费了 Barrier 微码。只要 &lt;div class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot; style=&quot;display:inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot; data-token-index=&quot;2&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot;&gt;all_idle=0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 就保持该状态，并保持 &lt;div class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot; style=&quot;display:inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot; data-token-index=&quot;4&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot;&gt;instr_ready=0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;；当 &lt;div class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot; style=&quot;display:inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot; data-token-index=&quot;6&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot;&gt;all_idle=1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; 时在下一个时钟沿返回 &lt;div class=&quot;notion-inline-code-container&quot; style=&quot;display:inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;SFMono-Regular&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;PT Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, Courier, monospace;line-height:normal;background:rgba(33, 27, 23, 0.05);color:rgba(207, 81, 72, 1);border-radius:4px;font-size:85%;padding:0.2em 0.4em;position:relative;bottom:0.065em&quot; data-token-index=&quot;8&quot; spellcheck=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot;&gt;D_IDLE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;。" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1800" y="1175" width="560" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="OTEody0B3dEsDwfKsCuh-164" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1800" y="1240" width="657.6" height="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XOfz9kekcGMyvx6_0SLD-1" value="Scoreboard" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="180" y="1970" width="170" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XOfz9kekcGMyvx6_0SLD-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Scoreboard不执行计算，也不保存微码。它为每个engine维护一个busy Bit，用于：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(255, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;1.告诉Decode 目标引擎能否接收新命令&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(255, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;2.告诉Barrier是否可以结束等待&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; color: rgb(255, 153, 153);&quot;&gt;3.告诉顶层所有已发射的硬件任务是否已经完成&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;也就是说，用来跟踪engine的bust状态，不检查不同engine之间的SRAM数据依赖。跨engine的RAW/WAR/WAW的顺序由host生成微码与OP_BARRIER保证&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="2030" width="580" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XOfz9kekcGMyvx6_0SLD-9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="XOfz9kekcGMyvx6_0SLD-3" target="XOfz9kekcGMyvx6_0SLD-5" edge="1">
